ss"},{type:"microshippers_price_groups",path:"/price-groups"},{type:"modal-page",path:"/modals/:uid"},{type:"pressHome",path:"/press"},{type:"press",path:"/press/:uid"},{type:"blogHome",path:"/news"},{type:"blog",path:"/news/:uid"},{type:"faq-page",path:"/faqs/:subpath2?/:uid",resolvers:{subpath2:"subpath2"}},{type:"landing-page",path:"/:uid"},{type:"content-page",path:"/:subpath1?/:subpath2?/:uid",resolvers:{subpath1:"subpath1",subpath2:"subpath2"}}]},preview:"/preview",toolbar:true,imports:["vue"],components:{richTextComponents:"~/prismic/richTextComponents"}}},app:{baseURL:"/",buildId:"7e544b5a-0a75-4bc7-b691-fdfd0ac7333b",buildAssetsDir:"/_nuxt/",cdnURL:""}}</script><script type="application/json" data-nuxt-data="nuxt-app" data-ssr="true" id="__NUXT_DATA__">[["ShallowReactive",1],{"prerenderedAt":2,"data":3,"state":260,"once":13564,"_errors":13565,"serverRendered":238,"path":13567,"pinia":13568},1784019888350,["ShallowReactive",4],{"content-page-subpath1:how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop":5,"page-header-video-undefined":29},{"uid":6,"document":7,"postSlices":259},"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop",{"titleTag":8,"metaDescription":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":22,"slices":23},"How to Start Selling on The TikTok Shop | Evri Business Guides","As one of the fastest growing online marketplaces, selling on TikTok will require a new approach. Connect with new customers and increase product sales.","how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":16,"slug":17,"first_publication_date":18,"last_publication_date":18,"uid":17,"link_type":19,"key":20,"isBroken":21},"ZL-1EREAACAAEkhR","subpath1",[15],"Guides","en-gb","guides","2023-07-25T12:59:36+0000","Document","52f21d9c-990b-4bfb-a12d-2a27b33cdb44",false,{"link_type":19},[24,52,69,100,113,140,169,192,199,221],{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":27,"primary":28,"id":50,"slice_type":51,"slice_label":29},"pageHeaderNoCta","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[],{"theme":29,"PageHeaderTitle":30,"PageHeaderText":31,"PageHeaderImage":37,"heroImage":48,"videoContent":49,"showPremiumLogo":29},null,"How to start selling on the TikTok Shop",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35,"direction":36},"paragraph","As one of the fastest growing online marketplaces, selling on TikTok will require a new approach",[],"ltr",{"dimensions":38,"alt":41,"copyright":29,"url":42,"id":43,"edit":44},{"width":39,"height":40},300,45,"Business","how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fa67ab394-df4f-431a-85c1-d7bec3a8d168_business.svg","YhYw-xIAAC0A0Qys",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$45e8eab9-817a-4efb-b2c5-49f9ad898658","page_header",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":54,"primary":55,"id":67,"slice_type":68,"slice_label":29},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":56,"CardTitle":57,"CardText":58,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":65,"IsEco":21},"none","Get ahead of the trends and open your TikTok shop account today",[59,62],{"type":33,"text":60,"spans":61,"direction":36},"This social media powerhouse is now a fast-moving and rapidly growing online marketplace that you don't want to miss out on.  Social media marketing is commonplace in businesses of all kinds, but whilst companies compete for paid partnerships and ad placement, platforms like TikTok are blurring the lines between authentic creator content, digital marketing and even sales. The TikTok Shop, launched in 2023, has already shown staggering statistics as a hybrid of short-form content feeds and online marketplaces. In an analysis by RootDigital, data shows that up to 71.2% of TikTok shoppers claimed to have made a purchase after receiving content advertising a product of interest. ",[],{"type":33,"text":63,"spans":64,"direction":36},"While the types of products that are typically successful on TikTok vary considerably, it is impossible to ignore the potential of immense success on the platform. However, you can't treat the TikTok Shop like traditional social media. New strategies are emerging every day in the ever-evolving viral marketing landscape, but with this guide we will prepare your business as best as we can to start selling on the TikTok Shop. ",[],{"link_type":66},"Any","card$5d98567d-e28b-4e04-b3ef-5a462708cde6","card",{"variation":70,"version":26,"items":71,"primary":72,"id":98,"slice_type":99,"slice_label":29},"default-slice",[],{"Image":73},{"dimensions":74,"alt":77,"copyright":29,"url":78,"id":79,"edit":80,"tablet":82,"mobile":89},{"width":75,"height":76},1200,280,"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen.","how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C3553%2C8192%2C1911&w=1200&h=280","Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ",{"x":45,"y":81,"zoom":46,"background":47},3553,{"dimensions":83,"alt":77,"copyright":29,"url":86,"id":79,"edit":87},{"width":84,"height":85},704,240,"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2671%2C8192%2C2793&w=704&h=240",{"x":45,"y":88,"zoom":46,"background":47},2671,{"dimensions":90,"alt":77,"copyright":29,"url":93,"id":79,"edit":94},{"width":91,"height":92},343,160,"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=918%2C2547%2C6253%2C2917&w=343&h=160",{"x":95,"y":96,"zoom":97,"background":47},918,2547,1.31,"photo_block$b32e9976-6d0f-4a52-af95-a07aceb6b537","photo_block",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":101,"primary":102,"id":112,"slice_type":68,"slice_label":29},[],{"CardAvatar":56,"CardTitle":103,"CardText":104,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":111,"IsEco":21},"How does the TikTok Shop work?",[105,108],{"type":33,"text":106,"spans":107,"direction":36},"The TikTok Shop is readily available for all users via its navigation bar. This is a more traditional marketplace interface, allowing sellers to set up their own online storefront. However, this is not where the majority of your sales will come from. TikTok also advertises products directly to a user via TikTok LIVE, in-feed videos (or “For You Page”) and the Showcase Tab. This is different from standard paid marketing content which is typically advertising an external service.",[],{"type":33,"text":109,"spans":110,"direction":36},"Understanding the way the TikTok Shop integrates into the average user’s consumption of content can be best achieved by engaging with the app yourself. The way a product ad will seamlessly integrate with your highly curated personal feed is staggering. You will quickly find that what appears to be an organic piece of creator content is actually directly advertising a product to you with a button on-screen. These have a far less “advert-y” feel to them and thus relate to customers in a way that other forms of marketing are often unable to.",[],{"link_type":66},"card$b4dedce0-baaa-44fa-954e-4f472125b162",{"variation":114,"version":26,"items":115,"primary":116,"id":139,"slice_type":68,"slice_label":29},"cardWithImageNoCta",[],{"CardImage":117,"CardAvatar":56,"CardTitle":125,"CardText":126,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":118,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":121,"id":122,"edit":123},{"width":119,"height":120},1000,665,"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C7008%2C4660&w=1000&h=665","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":45,"y":124,"zoom":46,"background":47},6,"How to open a TikTok Shop account",[127,130,133,136],{"type":33,"text":128,"spans":129,"direction":36},"You can open either a personal sender account or a business account on TikTok, allowing senders of all sizes to start listing products. Simply create a TikTok account and fill out the form with your relevant details and once you’ve been approved, your online store is officially open.",[],{"type":33,"text":131,"spans":132,"direction":36},"Start uploading your products to get started, treating your TikTok storefront the same way you would a website or a high street window. Be mindful of your customers’ experience visiting your store. Repeat business is just as important on TikTok as it is on any other online marketplace. ",[],{"type":33,"text":134,"spans":135,"direction":36},"For new sellers to the platform, TikTok are even offering zero product listing fees and reduced commission. ",[],{"type":33,"text":137,"spans":138,"direction":36},"",[],"card$523580c6-0421-40f4-905a-b1757c21283d",{"variation":53,"version":26,"items":141,"primary":142,"id":168,"slice_type":68,"slice_label":29},[],{"CardAvatar":56,"CardTitle":143,"CardText":144,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":167,"IsEco":21},"Hot products to start selling on the TikTok Shop",[145,148,152,155,158,161,164],{"type":33,"text":146,"spans":147,"direction":36},"The TikTok Shop advertising process is designed to facilitate impulse purchases above all else, making affordable items the best choice for this type of consumer. Within that, however, the range of products that you can sell is vast and limited only by your ability to demonstrate your product in a way that catches the eye of a passing scroller. Here are just a few successful products taken directly from TikTok themselves:",[],{"type":149,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":36},"list-item","Casual dresses",[],{"type":149,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":36},"Hoodies & jumpers",[],{"type":149,"text":156,"spans":157,"direction":36},"Earphones & headphones",[],{"type":149,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":36},"Cases, screen protectors & stickers",[],{"type":149,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":36},"Makeup tools",[],{"type":149,"text":165,"spans":166,"direction":36},"Frames and glasses",[],{"link_type":66},"card$ad8d9ee4-4f90-403a-970e-8995813fcdfc",{"variation":170,"version":26,"items":171,"primary":172,"id":190,"slice_type":191,"slice_label":29},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":173,"show_premium_logo":21,"label":29,"label_theme":174,"titleH2":175,"bodyText":176,"image":183,"rightImage":21,"buttonText":29,"buttonLink":188,"buttonDataGtmTrack":29,"primary_button_external":21,"button_secondary":189,"secondary_button_external":21},"standard","Core","Utilise viral marketing to sell products on TikTok",[177,180],{"type":33,"text":178,"spans":179,"direction":36},"TikTok allows you to utilise intuitive creator tools when crafting your soon-to-be viral hit, which offers many new and interesting methods of marketing your products. You might struggle to offer the same types of ads that you are used to running for paid advertising. Capitalising on viral trends, shortform videos and engaging organic content will allow you to blend in with a user’s typical scrolling experience and sell them your product in an unintrusive manner.",[],{"type":33,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":36},"TikTok is, however, somewhat of a sub-culture. You might find yourself scratching your head trying to understand the trends that audiences are responding to. That’s why TikTok introduced the Affiliate programme to allow sellers to partner with reputable influencers who will make this content for you and sell your products. You might not understand half of their references, jokes, or even words, but you can trust them to engage their targeted audience and leverage that trust to promote your products. Take care of choosing your affiliates though, as simply being able to sell a product doesn’t always equate to long term trust or positive brand recognition. A good balance of proven viral marketing expertise and audience compatibility will define your perfect affiliate influencer.",[],{"dimensions":184,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":185,"id":186,"edit":187},{"width":119,"height":120},"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ36y_pbqstJ99L1P_WomanfilmingEvriVideovideo.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C6720%2C4469&w=1000&h=665","Z36y_pbqstJ99L1P",{"x":45,"y":124,"zoom":46,"background":47},{"link_type":66},{"link_type":66},"landing_feature_banner$53f25b5d-a4a8-476b-ab88-471d653b8820","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":70,"version":26,"items":193,"primary":194,"id":198,"slice_type":99,"slice_label":29},[],{"Image":195},{"tablet":196,"mobile":197},{},{},"photo_block$52f1d441-e9c4-4893-8f65-53c2164814ed",{"variation":70,"version":26,"items":200,"primary":201,"id":220,"slice_type":68,"slice_label":29},[],{"CardImage":202,"CardAvatar":56,"CardTitle":207,"CardText":208,"ButtonText":215,"ButtonUrl":216,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":203,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":204,"id":205,"edit":206},{"width":119,"height":120},"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ0XA968jQArT1Ugv_Mansendinglotsofparcels.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C6882%2C4577&w=1000&h=665","Z0XA968jQArT1Ugv",{"x":45,"y":124,"zoom":46,"background":47},"Integrate your TikTok Shop with Evri for incredible benefits",[209,212],{"type":33,"text":210,"spans":211,"direction":36},"Streamline your logistics and offer additional benefits by connecting your TikTok Shop to Evri. While TikTok offers built-in shipping, integrating with a trusted courier like Evri is often more efficient—especially if you sell across multiple platforms.",[],{"type":33,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":36},"Evri’s bulk integrations tool lets you link accounts and manage high-volume parcel bookings across the UK and internationally. You’ll save time and unlock additional benefits for your customers. Trusted nationwide, Evri helps you focus on growing your brand with TikTok’s creator tools while we handle the shipping.",[],"Integrate your TikTok Shop",{"link_type":217,"key":218,"url":219},"Web","b511ac23-daad-46be-ac26-7a59eccb569c","how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send","card$00468ce5-c5bf-4eb4-8862-2185362f0736",{"variation":70,"version":26,"items":222,"primary":223,"id":257,"slice_type":258,"slice_label":29},[],{"title":224,"bodyText":225,"isEco":21,"PaddingTop":21,"PaddingBottom":21,"NoMarginBottom":21,"hasButton":238,"buttonText":239,"buttonLink":240,"image":251},"Do you qualify for a business account?",[226,229,232,235],{"type":33,"text":227,"spans":228,"direction":36},"If you’re sending over 150 parcels a week, then you could be eligible for one of our business accounts. We’ll help to grow your business by streamlining your parcel shipping experience and providing extra resources to reduce hassle. Our business account benefits include",[],{"type":149,"text":230,"spans":231,"direction":36},"Regular van collections straight from your home or office",[],{"type":149,"text":233,"spans":234,"direction":36},"Enhanced customer service for support on your deliveries",[],{"type":149,"text":236,"spans":237,"direction":36},"Discounted shipping to reward your success",[],true,"Enquire today for a business account",{"id":241,"type":242,"tags":243,"lang":16,"slug":245,"first_publication_date":246,"last_publication_date":247,"uid":248,"url":249,"link_type":19,"key":250,"isBroken":21},"Yh9ZyRIAAC4A-Qlw","content-page",[244],"Business Accounts","business-courier--parcel-delivery-service-uk--evri","2022-03-02T12:16:22+0000","2026-05-01T10:34:57+0000","business-accounts","\u002Fbusiness-accounts","b7b43610-db1a-4d5d-b859-63522dbff108",{"dimensions":252,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":254,"id":255,"edit":256},{"width":119,"height":253},643,"how-to-sell-on-tiktok-shop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZyIqu68jQArT0BYb_small_business.jpg?auto=format,compress","ZyIqu68jQArT0BYb",{"x":45,"y":45,"zoom":46,"background":47},"feature_banner$bf1d7250-86fc-4420-80f8-6df9e152fc25","feature_banner",[24,52,69,100,113,140,169,192,199,221],["Reactive",261],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":262,"$sclients":328,"$sglobal-